        "施放<span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\">普攻·溯念留形第3段</span>期间，洛瑟菈每隔一段时间将消耗1张<span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\">【<u>照片</u>】</span>施放<span style=\"color:#ffd12f;\">遗忘</span>造成1次<span style=\"color:#41aefb;\">冷凝伤害</span>:",
